data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `evidence-package-generation` skill 的 Agent 真链路，测试用例：`evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech`。\n\n测试说明：Build an evidence package by retrieving the ShanghaiTech video from ES.\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的核心字段和简短结论；如果失败，保留 error_code/message/detail。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nevent = {\"event_id\": \"EVT_SHANGHAITECH_07_007_AGENT_TEST\", \"video_id\": \"shanghaitech-07-007-agent-test\", \"camera_id\": \"CAM_SHANGHAITECH_07_007\", \"event_type\": \"manual_evidence\", \"event_time\": \"2026-06-02T00:00:01+08:00\", \"event_elapsed_seconds\": 1, \"confidence\": 0.8, \"description\": \"Evidence package smoke event for ShanghaiTech sample 07_007.\"}\np = pathlib.Path(\"/mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/event.json\")\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(event, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/scripts/run.py --video-id shanghaitech-07-007-agent-test --event-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/event.json --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/package --index huangxiao-shanghaitech-es-agent-test --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-generation-shanghaitech/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"a87cf4f3-683f-442c-8f97-fae13614f8b7"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":91,"prompt_tokens":9793,"total_tokens":9884,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":32,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":91},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":9793}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-69898b28-6ede-9241-a38b-36b20b70e4c4","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8428-797a-7943-a4be-4032c9b6186a-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 evidence-package-generation skill 文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/evidence-package-generation/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_4b78349c08544204b4711b6e","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":9793,"output_tokens":91,"total_tokens":9884,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":32}}},{"content":"---\nname: evidence-package-generation\ndescription: Generate an evidence package manifest for indexed monitoring videos or event/search results, including snapshot evidence and optional short video clips. Use when Codex needs a package_id, manifest URI, evidence items, hashes, and reusable evidence artifacts.\n---\n\n# Evidence Package Generation\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nUse `--event-json` when the user provides an event. Use `--search-result-json` when the user wants evidence for search hits. Use `--video-id` to retrieve a source video document from Elasticsearch.\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\n```bash\npython evidence-package-generation/scripts/run.py --video-id <video_id> --event-json <event.json> --output-dir <package_dir> --index citybrain-video-library --config <config.json> --output <result.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--input`, `--index`, `--video-id`, `--event-json`, `--search-result-json`, `--output-dir`, `--pre-seconds`, `--post-seconds`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Resolve package items from event JSON, search results, or Elasticsearch video id lookup.\n2. Generate snapshot evidence when event frames are available.\n3. Generate a short clip when source video and event timing are available.\n4. Write a package manifest JSON containing evidence artifacts and integrity hashes.\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `package_id`, `manifest_uri`, `items`, and `evidence`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_INPUT`\n- `ES_CONNECTION_FAILED`\n- `ES_REQUEST_FAILED`\n- Nested evidence generation failures are included per item.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not decide whether an event occurred and do not modify event confidence. This skill packages already available video/event evidence.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"56358b76-05cb-4dd6-8982-77fd5ec89c76","tool_call_id":"call_4b78349c08544204b4711b6e","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在执行测试命令：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":398,"prompt_tokens":10273,"total_tokens":10671,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":0,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":398},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10273}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.5-plus","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-59d0d5ab-5ce3-9e10-9063-c03cefec8cac","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019e8428-a309-7cf0-ae80-ccb084ca732a-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"description":"执行 evidence-package-generation 测试用例","command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-package-genera